---
// ProcessGrid.astro
---
<section class="process container">
  <div class="section-header reveal-up">
    <h2 class="text-uppercase font-sans">The Process</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="process-grid">
    <div class="process-step reveal-up delay-1">
      <div class="step-number font-serif italic text-accent">01</div>
      <h3 class="text-uppercase">Discover</h3>
      <p>Understanding your vision, context, and the fundamental requirements of the space.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="process-step reveal-up delay-2">
      <div class="step-number font-serif italic text-accent">02</div>
      <h3 class="text-uppercase">Concept</h3>
      <p>Translating requirements into a cohesive design narrative, materiality, and spatial flow.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="process-step reveal-up delay-3">
      <div class="step-number font-serif italic text-accent">03</div>
      <h3 class="text-uppercase">Detail</h3>
      <p>Refining every architectural detail, custom furniture specification, and lighting plan.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="process-step reveal-up delay-4">
      <div class="step-number font-serif italic text-accent">04</div>
      <h3 class="text-uppercase">Deliver</h3>
      <p>Executing the turnkey design with precision through our trusted network of master craftsmen and contractors across Mumbai.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .process {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .process-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .process-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .process-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 0;
    }
  }

  .process-step {
    padding: var(--space-md);
    background-color: var(--c-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    transition: transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Overlap borders to create a clean grid on desktop */
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .process-step {
      border-right: none;
    }
    .process-step:last-child {
      border-right: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    }
  }

  .process-step:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    z-index: 1; /* bring above others */
  }

  .step-number {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .process-step h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .process-step p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
